---
title: "Sci-fi creator"
note: "A character among the stars for Krea 2: a human or one of forty species beyond them (spacers, clones, androids, robots, insectoids, reptiloids, felinoids, crystalline and energy beings, uplifted apes …), each with its own body, so a robot rolls no hairstyle and no gender. One of thirty roles (captain, pilot, engineer, space marine, xenobiologist, bounty hunter, smuggler, miner …) brings its clothes and its gear, or a spacefarer's outfit instead; a ship's cat in a space suit or a robot now and then, a motif in the signature colour on the clothes. It keeps what the picture cannot show (EXPORT:): the species, the role, the gear, a companion, a mood, a quirk, two skills, a voice. One seed is one character, from four sides by the grid: the close views show the head, the shoulders and the clothes, the full-length view the gear and the companion too; $backdrop puts it on a ship or a world instead of the studio, $view one side only to try characters faster."
tags: [krea, characters, references, scifi]
---
$colour = __characters/creator/colour__
$species = __characters/scifi/species__
$gender = {IF $species.gender is no: none|{woman:4|man:4|person}}
$fit = {IF $gender is woman: women|{IF $gender is man: men|all}}
$age = {young:3|seasoned:3|grizzled:2|veteran}
$build = __characters/creator/build__
$face = __characters/creator/face__
$eyes = __characters/creator/eyes__
$haircolour = {__characters/creator/haircolour__:5|$colour-dyed|silver|white}
$hair = __characters/creator/hair[fit=$fit|all]__
$beard = {IF $species.beard is yes: {IF $gender is man: {__characters/creator/beard__|none:2}|none}|none}
$mark = __characters/creator/mark__
$role = __characters/scifi/role__
$outfit = {$role.wear:3|__characters/creator/outfit[genre=spacefarer, fit=$fit|all]__:2}
$gear = $role.gear
$motif = __characters/creator/motif[genre=spacefarer|all]__
$companion = {__characters/creator/companion[genre=spacefarer]__|none:3}
$presence = __characters/creator/presence__
$backdrop = {studio:3|place}
# A species takes the parts its body has: a human-like one face, eyes, hair and a mark; beastlike ones their eyes; the others only their own look.
$folk = {IF $gender is none: $age $species|$age $species $gender}
$body = {IF $species.like is human: $species.look, $build, $face, $eyes, $hair{IF $beard is not none: , $beard|} and $mark|{IF $species.like is beast: {IF $species.eyes is own: $species.look|$species.look, $eyes}|$species.look}}
$person = a $folk with $body: $role in $outfit, their clothes marked by $motif
$who = $person, with $gear{IF $companion is not none: , $companion|}
# What the picture carries beyond its prompt (EXPORT:): a screenplay that casts it reads $hero.who, $hero.species, $hero.role …
EXPORT:
  who = $who
  $species
  $gender
  age = $age
  $role
  gear = $gear
  companion = $companion
  $colour
  mood = __characters/creator/mood__
  quirk = __characters/creator/quirk__
  skills = {2$$__characters/creator/skill[genre=spacefarer|all]__}
  voice = __characters/creator/voice__
# The grid runs every view: one character from four sides. Set $view to one of them to try characters faster.
# The shot comes first and the picture names only what it can show: the close views the head, the shoulders and the clothes; the full-length view the gear too, and the companion in a sentence of its own.
$look = {photo:5|animated:2|anime:2|painted}
$view = {portrait|three-quarter|full-length|profile}
$opening = {IF $look is photo: A cinematic photograph, as from the set of a space opera|{IF $look is animated: A 3D character render, in the style of a modern animated feature film|{IF $look is anime: An anime character design|A painted science-fiction character study, in the style of a vintage paperback cover}}}
$shot = {IF $view is portrait: a head-and-shoulders portrait|{IF $view is three-quarter: a head-and-shoulders view|{IF $view is full-length: a full-length view of the whole body, from the top of the head to the feet,|a strict side profile of the head and shoulders}}}
$stand = They stand straight with the arms relaxed, facing the camera, with $gear, and floor and space around them are in frame.
$pose = {IF $view is portrait: They face the camera.|{IF $view is three-quarter: They are turned three-quarters to the left.|{IF $view is full-length: {IF $companion is not none: $stand With them: $companion.|$stand}|The face is seen exactly from the side, turned 90 degrees to the left, the nose pointing at the left edge of the frame and only one eye visible.}}}
$finish = {IF $look is photo: Shot on an 85mm lens at eye level, true colours, practical costume and prosthetics.|{IF $look is animated: Stylised proportions, soft subsurface skin.|{IF $look is anime: Clean line art and flat cel shading.|Bold gouache colour and a fine airbrushed glow.}}}
$opening: $shot of $person, with $presence. $pose Behind them is {IF $backdrop is studio: a seamless mid-grey studio backdrop|__characters/scifi/place__}, in soft, even light. $finish
@size 832x1216
@grid $view
